And I mean, most simply put, a non-relational database is just a database that doesn't support

01:11:53.440 --> 01:11:56.880
those kinds of complex relationships between data.

01:11:56.880 --> 01:12:02.480
And typically, when we're talking about like no SQL non-relational databases, we're talking

01:12:02.480 --> 01:12:05.480
about databases that nest data.

