So rather than using keys to reference other data and keeping everything kind of nice and

01:12:11.160 --> 01:12:16.720
tight and normalized, which is a concept that we'll talk about more later, they just kind

01:12:16.720 --> 01:12:23.080
of lazily nest the data within itself, which does have benefits.

