I don't know if you can tell, but there's actually two underscores, but now this is

02:22:41.200 --> 02:22:45.800
going to match things like shoot and group, but importantly, it will not match things

02:22:45.800 --> 02:22:51.080
like boot, root foot, right, explicitly going to have five characters.

02:22:51.080 --> 02:22:52.080
Okay.

02:22:52.080 --> 02:22:54.920
HR has been able to narrow down their query even further.

02:22:54.920 --> 02:22:59.400
They want a report of all users whose names start with a L and are exactly five characters

02:22:59.400 --> 02:23:00.400
long.

02:23:00.400 --> 02:23:01.400
Okay.

02:23:01.400 --> 02:23:14.920
So let's do select star from users where name, like underscore, underscore, underscore,

02:23:14.920 --> 02:23:17.040
but an Al at the beginning.

