Let's see values that start with or yup and have three characters exactly.

02:24:00.360 --> 02:24:06.440
No, because we've got this wildcard here that could be zero or more characters values that

02:24:06.440 --> 02:24:08.440
end in or no, that's not it.

02:24:08.440 --> 02:24:10.280
Values that end in or no, that's not it.

02:24:10.280 --> 02:24:13.240
Values that start with or and are at least three characters in length.

