with a database and just trying to like figure out what the data sort of looks like.

02:27:24.520 --> 02:27:25.520
Right?

02:27:25.520 --> 02:27:27.100
So you've got a database, we got a table in it.

02:27:27.100 --> 02:27:28.880
It has a hundred thousand records.

