Then we'll create another group.

03:11:34.600 --> 03:11:40.960
Pythonistas, max size of 30.

03:11:40.960 --> 03:11:43.520
Okay, got a couple groups.

03:11:43.520 --> 03:11:45.120
And actually, just so that they're different.

03:11:45.120 --> 03:11:46.120
Let's add a third group.

